WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.173
Unit eleven. How Germs Spread!

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.798
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.848 --> 00:00:11.287
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.337 --> 00:00:15.140
Today we learn about How Germs Spread. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.171 --> 00:00:19.621
Germs. Say it with me. Germs!

6
00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:26.442
Cough. Say it with me. Cough!

7
00:00:29.937 --> 00:00:32.970
Touch. Say it with me. Touch!

8
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:39.923
Hands. Say it with me. Hands!

9
00:00:43.423 --> 00:00:47.040
Surface. Say it with me. Surface!

10
00:00:50.545 --> 00:00:53.762
Food. Say it with me. Food!

11
00:00:57.247 --> 00:01:00.781
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

12
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.964
Spread. Say it with me. Spread!

13
00:01:11.472 --> 00:01:20.583
Germs spread when people cough, sneeze, or touch a surface with dirty hands. Germs can also get into food. Washing hands is the best way to stop germs from spreading.

14
00:01:20.633 --> 00:01:21.783
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.105 --> 00:01:28.573
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.623 --> 00:01:29.750
Touch!

17
00:01:30.435 --> 00:01:35.622
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:35.672 --> 00:01:36.822
Wash!

19
00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:42.999
Did you know? Germs are so tiny that you need a microscope to see them!

20
00:01:43.049 --> 00:01:45.067
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.751 --> 00:01:53.353
Think and answer. Name two ways germs can spread.

22
00:01:53.403 --> 00:01:54.553
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.745 --> 00:02:00.475
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.525 --> 00:02:03.176
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

